              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Di in Texas"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this pretty much as listed, but I used organic petite diced tomatoes (juice drained of course). I also used whole cumin that I toasted and ground before adding to salsa. This added great flavor!\nThis was easy to make,and even the kidos gobbled it up. Thanks!"
          },
